  "caption": "Purani family photo 1 minute mein nayi, free AI se. Studio ke paise bachao.\nGemini app mein old photo restore, ek prompt se, phone pe hi.\n\n3 step:\n1. Purani photo ki din ki roshni mein seedhi photo lo\n2. Gemini app kholo, + dabao, photo upload karo\n3. Prompt: \"Is purani photo ko restore karo, kharonch aur daag hatao. Chehra bilkul waisa hi rakho, asli rang bharo.\"\n\nTrick: pehle sirf kharonch hatwao, phir agle message mein rang.\nSirf blur photo? Google Photos mein Edit > Tools > Unblur.\n\nSach: Gemini mein photo editing 18+ ke liye hai, free plan mein roz ki limit hai, aur AI kabhi chehra badal deta hai. Asli photo hamesha sambhal ke rakho.\n\nComment mein PHOTO likho, sabko reply karunga.\n\n#aitools #aitoolsforfree #geminiai #photorestoration #aihindi"
